        {
            "title": "Optimize the terrain of small towns in the western region",
            "date": "2025-08-07 09:23:33",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909571271",
            "content": "[olist]\n[*] Optimize the terrain of small towns in the western region\n[*] Optimize the fragmented experience of some scenery in western towns\n[*] Fine tune the properties of certain necklaces\n[*] Add 3 new bows\n[*] Optimize data loading\n[/olist]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Optimize startup loading",
            "date": "2025-08-06 05:23:36",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909532463",
            "content": "[olist]\n[*] Optimize startup loading\n[*] Optimize the damage performance of the combustion bottle to enemies\n[/olist]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Optimize the collision between rainwater and water surface",
            "date": "2025-08-06 04:35:43",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909531540",
            "content": "[olist]\n[*] Optimize the collision between rainwater and water surface\n[*] Key display price\n[*] Optimize the display of treasure chests in large map replica strongholds\n[*] Optimize the location of destructive power generated during protagonist attacks\n[*] Fix the bug of occasional MISS in the attack scene\n[*] The protagonist also displays an upgrade message prompt when upgrading the big map\n[*] Delay the generation of elite monsters in the wilderness stronghold a bit\n[*] Extend the protection time of the portal\n[*] Optimize the drop position of the treasure chest\n[*] In combat scenes, the mouse wheel can zoom in and out of the camera distance\n[/olist]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Slightly reduce the monster's numerical strength",
            "date": "2025-08-05 06:01:11",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490840113",
            "content": "[olist]\n[*] Slightly reduce the monster's numerical strength\n[*] If you don't hit in melee, it will show a miss\n[*] Occasionally, some fish swim to the sky\n[*] Optimization of desert peripheral background\n[*] Optimize the edge height of outdoor terrain\n[*] Optimizing the performance of natural flame combustion\n[*] Optimize the interface animation when taking medication\n[/olist]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Bug fix",
            "date": "2025-08-04 12:08:21",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490815590",
            "content": "[olist]\n[*] Fix a small number of bugs in mercenaries\n[*] Optimize the default stroke of monsters\n[*] Monsters and animals can also step on the trap\n[*] Add a protection time to the portal\n[*] Optimize the coordinate distribution of items dropped after opening the treasure chest\n[*] Bug fix: Abnormal flickering on the surface of rocks in snowy scenes\n[*] Bug fix: The menu during conversations with NPCs may obscure the backpack\n[/olist]"
        },
        {
            "title": "Optimize startup loading",
